        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant
Some data for air and water emissions in the country. The data were partly given aggregated for oil and gas use.;
UUID: 5bb9da87-f59e-361f-9978-09f2741e56cb
All energy use, use of chemicals, emissions to air and water including treatment of flue gasses and effluents.
Location: Estimation for the country.
Technology: Estimation for average technology.
Time period: Environmental reports of single plants for 2000, other data for Europe.
Production volume: 7.2 TWh from power plants and 3.8 TWh from combined cycle plants.
Sampling: Literature, environmental reports 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5bb9da87-f59e-361f-9978-09f2741e56cb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
